/T (14.4  Except for the cases mentioned in Articles 14.1 to 14.3, MAC will not be liable for damages on any account whatsoever.  14.5  MAC will exercise due care when engaging third parties. MAC will not be liable for any errors and/or failures of such third parties. This does not apply to third parties which act as subcontractors and which act under the responsibility of MAC.  14.6  The limitations on liability laid down in Article 14 operate both on behalf of MAC \(itself\) and of the persons, individually as well as jointly, within the Engagement Team.  14.7  MAC Member Firms other than MAC \(whether or not engaged in the performance of the Work\) will never be liable for any loss suffered on the part of the Client in connection with the Work. The limitations on liability laid down in this Article 14 will also operate on behalf of all MAC Member Firms other than MAC \(whether or not engaged in the performance of the Work\). )
