/Title (15.1  The Client will indemnify MAC against any and all claims of third parties arising from or connected to the Work performed or to be performed for the Client, unless such claims result from intent or willful recklessness on the part of MAC's executive staff. The indemnity will include all loss suffered and legal and other costs incurred by MAC in connection with claims.  15.2  The indemnity under paragraph 1 of this Article is also stipulated on behalf of the persons, both individually and jointly, forming the Engagement Team, and on behalf of the other MAC Member Firms engaged by MAC for the performance of the Work.)
